From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bjarne <87858321+bjakra@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 17:23:44 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Keybox import endpoint for the Graphite mirror resolver
 (0661)

Add KeyboxImportService: a permission-gated Binder endpoint (AIDL
IKeyboxImportService, package app.grapheneos.gmscompat.keybox) that the
graphite_parts mirror resolver delivers an already-locally-validated keybox
XML to. The service re-runs the same PlayKeybox.parse validation as a manual
import on KeyboxActivity before storing 0600; invalid deliveries are logged and
refused. It never touches the enabled switch. Exported behind
org.graphite.parts.permission.IMPORT_KEYBOX (signature-level, defined in
GraphiteParts), so only that platform-signed app can call it.

Add a play_keybox.provenance sidecar to KeyboxStore ("mirror: <source>"),
surfaced via KeyboxState.provenance and set by importKeybox(xml, provenance);
cleared in lock-step on clear().

